      "row_id": "3a55fc1bf8b82677fb57f51bee24a58ea6c17adda3743306d9f0d827b7810089:000000_-2858949829448152061:g0:r12",
      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "それなら何よりです。\n今取り組んでいるのは、新しい実験ですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ccfc13d5e2c00bc9e58079d1794d71918cc8c6a144ae4a15aa46bd7a81d9de03",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "助手くん！　よくぞ聞いてくれた。\n私はね、このチョコレートが人体に与える効果について、\n研究していたところなんだよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "023b16015d4cc7c071e6b3449a87e4cb2fb30c30059fdeea39a19851be53d956",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "조수 군! 잘 물어봤어.\n나는 이 초콜릿이 인체에 미치는 효과를,\n연구하고 있던 참이야.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
