        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "チョコレートの研究？　手作りチョコレートのではなく？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8b557b12777f649ff05846807862d8c5550a31d4adb336737e12df8ffb684287",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ああ。最初はそのつもりだったんだが、\n調べていくうちに興味深い事実を知ることができてね。",
      "jp_sha256": "7486e8212f393b7af8f096653bde368a04e71c598655b01fef8f63f01fed3781",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래. 처음에는 그럴 생각이었지만,\n조사하다가 흥미로운 사실을 알게 됐거든.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3a55fc1bf8b82677fb57f51bee24a58ea6c17adda3743306d9f0d827b7810089:000000_-2858949829448152061:g0:r16",
      "row_index_0based": 16,
      "serialized_row_index": 16,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ラプルムバレンタイン",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ああ。最初はそのつもりだったんだが、\n調べていくうちに興味深い事実を知ることができてね。",
        "",
        "ch_10324/R18/10324A0_10324_Nml/10324A0_10324_004",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ラプルムバレンタイン",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10324/R18/10324A0_10324_Nml/10324A0_10324_004"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "aa95dc1323fb64be9265ca740c6bbe40244673388fc5d4f281e32bfa134f6072",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "実はチョコレートは、甘くておいしいだけではない。\n疲労回復や幸福感の獲得、様々な栄養を摂取することが可能。\nそう判明したんだ！",
      "jp_sha256": "72428e0d92fa14714bc267b24322380195418cf0d7eb3f034e203e114bf76667",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "사실 초콜릿은 달고 맛있기만 한 것이 아니야.\n피로 회복과 행복감 획득, 여러 영양 섭취도 가능하지.\n그 사실을 밝혀냈어!",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
